&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;THG is proud to be a Disability Confident Committed employer. If you are invited to interview, please let us know if there are any reasonable adjustments we can make to the recruitment process that will enable you to perform to the best of your ability.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;THG is committed to creating a diverse &amp;amp; inclusive environment and hence welcomes applications from all sections of the community.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Because of the high volumes of applications our opportunities attract, it sometimes takes us time to review and consider them all. We endeavour to respond to every application we receive within 14 days. If you haven&#39;t heard from us within that time frame or should you have any specific questions about this or other applications for positions at THG please contact one of our &lt;span class=&quot;mark75xs2u5gf&quot; data-markjs=&quot;true&quot; data-ogac=&quot;&quot; data-ogab=&quot;&quot; data-ogsc=&quot;&quot; data-ogsb=&quot;&quot;&gt;Talent&lt;/span&gt; team to discuss further.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role…&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Soho House, a &lt;strong&gt;Waiter&lt;/strong&gt; plays an essential role in delivering refined, attentive, and personalised service to our members and guests. Working closely with the floor and kitchen teams, you are responsible for ensuring a smooth dining experience while reflecting the Club’s standards of professionalism, discretion, and excellence.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Your main responsibility is to ensure that members have an enjoyable experience. You will deliver excellent service from initial greeting, taking orders, making recommendations and paying of the bill.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What&#39;s in it for you?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Weekly Pay&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Team meal whilst on shift prepared by our chefs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Soho Friends Membership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;50% Team discount on Food &amp;amp; Drink, 7 days a week&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Staff Room Rates&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Health Cash Plan (option to up to 2 additional dependents)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Dental Plan (option to add up to 2 additional dependents)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Birthday Day Off after 1 years&#39; continuous service&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Up to 50% Staff Discount on Cowshed &amp;amp; Soho Home&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;In conjunction with Soho Impact, take 2 days paid a year to support a charity of your choice.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Free Counselling Sessions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cookhouse &amp;amp; House Tonic: Our Cookhouse &amp;amp; Tonic Programmes offer unique food and drink training, events and opportunities to inspire and educate.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Continuous training to develop yourself personally and professionally&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Team Events: From fitness sessions to cinema screenings and art classes, each month we hold a series of fun events which you can sign up to.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Soho House offers competitive compensation packages that feature global benefits and perks. Whether you’re seeking entry-level employment or a new opportunity to expand your profession, we offer training to develop the technical and managerial skills necessary to enhance your career&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key duties…&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Warmly greet members, introduce menus, and ensure immediate engagement upon seating.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Take accurate food and drink orders, accommodating any allergies or dietary needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deliver a seamless service by coordinating with kitchen and bar staff, ensuring timely and correct order delivery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide knowledgeable recommendations on menu items, including food and drink pairings.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain exceptional table service—top up water, wine, and beverages proactively throughout the member’s stay.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure a pristine environment, including setting up and resetting tables, and maintaining cleanliness at all times.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Handle member requests and special accommodations with flexibility to create memorable, personalized experiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support seamless payment through card, the Soho House App, or House Pay.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Uphold discretion and professionalism, especially when serving VIPs and PWKs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to team success, attending briefings, tastings, and assisting colleagues where needed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we are looking for...&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;2–3 years in a similar high-end dining environment.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Thrive in fast-paced, high-volume environments and maintain calm, through quickly and effectively problem solving under pressure&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Must be hospitable, approachable, passionate about customer service and respectful towards colleagues and guests&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Must be able to demonstrate competency as outlined in the training schedule and Club School&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Must be able to work flexible shifts and schedules, including weekends and holidays as needed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to take direction, work in a team environment and autonomously&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;The salary range for this role if filled within the UK is listed below. The range for the position in different geographies may vary based on market differences.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Pay Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;£15.50&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;£15.50 GBP&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role…&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Soho House, a &lt;strong&gt;Runner&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW261034919 BCX0&quot; lang=&quot;EN-GB&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW261034919 BCX0&quot;&gt;plays a vital supporting role in ensuring the smooth and efficient flow of service between the kitchen and front-of-house teams. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW88640186 BCX0&quot; lang=&quot;EN-GB&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW88640186 BCX0&quot;&gt;As a key link in the dining experience, the Runner &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW88640186 BCX0&quot;&gt;is responsible for&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW88640186 BCX0&quot;&gt; delivering food and beverages promptly, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW88640186 BCX0&quot;&gt;maintaining&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW88640186 BCX0&quot;&gt; cleanliness and organisation across the service &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW88640186 BCX0&quot;&gt;areas.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP SCXW88640186 BCX0&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW12820748 BCX0&quot;&gt;Y&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW12820748 BCX0&quot;&gt;our main responsibility is to &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW12820748 BCX0&quot;&gt;assist&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW12820748 BCX0&quot;&gt; the waiting staff and make sure the member gets a superior experience. You will deliver food orders from the kitchen (or drinks orders from the bar) to members’ tables, acting as a point of contact between the kitchen/bar and the floor. &lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What&#39;s in it for you?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Weekly Pay&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Team meal whilst on shift prepared by our chefs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Soho Friends Membership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;50% Team discount on Food &amp;amp; Drink, 7 days a week&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Staff Room Rates&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Health Cash Plan (option to up to 2 additional dependents)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Dental Plan (option to add up to 2 additional dependents)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Birthday Day Off after 1 years&#39; continuous service&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Up to 50% Staff Discount on Cowshed &amp;amp; Soho Home&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;In conjunction with Soho Impact, take 2 days paid a year to support a charity of your choice.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Free Counselling Sessions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cookhouse &amp;amp; House Tonic: Our Cookhouse &amp;amp; Tonic Programmes offer unique food and drink training, events and opportunities to inspire and educate.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Continuous training to develop yourself personally and professionally&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Team Events: From fitness sessions to cinema screenings and art classes, each month we hold a series of fun events which you can sign up to.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Soho House offers competitive compensation packages that feature global benefits and perks. Whether you’re seeking entry-level employment or a new opportunity to expand your profession, we offer training to develop the technical and managerial skills necessary to enhance your career&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key duties…&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bring food/drink quickly from the kitchen/bar to its respective location in the restaurants and deliver to members. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain a spotless, pristine work environment&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provides service to and is accountable for an assigned section.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop relationships with members to provide personalized service.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Polishing cutlery ensuring they are ready for service. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Preparing any additions to tables in advance (preparing lemon wraps, condiments, butter portions etc)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Perform opening and closing procedures including but not limited to the set up and break down of stations.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure all service equipment is handled carefully and stored correctly.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain a spotless and pristine working environment. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Attending regular meetings with front and back of house teams to learn about any menu changes and specials alongside daily tastings.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we are looking for...&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;2–3 years in a similar high-end dining environment&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent food and beverage knowledge, including wine service&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong interpersonal and teamwork skills with a hands-on approach&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Confident, polished, and professional demeanour&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional communication and organisational skills&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with POS systems and reservation software&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;The salary range for this role if filled within the UK is listed below. The range for the position in different geographies may vary based on market differences.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Pay Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;£14.50&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;£14.50 GBP&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;THE POSITION&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Our roster has an opening with your name on it&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Much of what decides whether a fan stays with FanDuel happens either side of the bet: the sign-up that takes a minute, the deposit that clears first time on a Sunday afternoon, the withdrawal that lands when we said it would, and the protections that work quietly in the background for the people who need them.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a Software Engineering Director to lead the teams behind that experience across FanDuel’s Customer Product Engineering (CPE) domain.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;CPE builds the systems fans touch first and trust most: payments and money movement, account and onboarding, geolocation, responsible gaming and player integrity, and the promotions, rewards and loyalty, campaign orchestration, personalisation and marketing messaging that shape every fan’s day-to-day experience. When CPE works, nobody notices. When it does not, a fan cannot get in, get funded, get paid or get looked after, and quality elsewhere in the product does not make up for it.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The mission: make it quick and predictable for every fan to join, fund an account, get paid and be protected, in every jurisdiction we operate in, on the busiest day of the sporting calendar. Making every moment more, for our customers. Your work always follows our principle &lt;em&gt;Everything Begins with the Customer.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;That means designing for extreme, event-driven peak load, where traffic arrives in minutes, and for a heavily regulated environment in which auditability and evidence matter as much as availability. It also means depending on other people’s systems: payment providers, identity and KYC vendors, geolocation suppliers. You build so that their bad day does not become our customers’ bad day.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a hands-on leadership role. You will lead managers and senior engineers across several teams, set technical direction alongside your Principal and Senior Staff Engineers, make the difficult calls that do not have obvious answers, and create the conditions in which good teams do the best work of their careers. You will work as closely with Product, Compliance, Risk, Finance and Customer Operations as you do with engineers, and you can explain a technical trade-off to an executive audience without diluting it.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You are candid about what is not working and you know when to look for consensus and when the decision is yours, &lt;em&gt;Challenge and Commit.&lt;/em&gt; You wear your FanDuel hat first and do not restrict yourself to organisational boundaries, &lt;em&gt;We are One Team.&lt;/em&gt; You are a visible part of the domain leadership team and a role model to the wider engineering community, &lt;em&gt;Humble and Hungry.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;THE GAME PLAN&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Everyone on our team has a part to play&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead multiple engineering teams within CPE, setting a clear technical vision for each area and holding delivery to it.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the customer outcomes your teams are accountable for, measured where the fan feels them: registration and verification completion, time to first bet, deposit and withdrawal success rates, payout speed, geolocation pass rates, and the availability of whole journeys rather than the uptime of individual services.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set the standard for availability and operational excellence in a domain where an outage stops the rest of the product working, including the KPIs, the instrumentation behind them, and the discipline to tell genuine degradation from noise.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prepare for event-driven peak load so that the biggest days in the sporting calendar are rehearsed, with capacity, failover and degradation behaviour proven in advance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Reduce the blast radius of third-party failure across payment providers, identity and KYC vendors and geolocation suppliers, using redundancy, graceful degradation and clear fallbacks so that a supplier’s outage does not become a customer’s.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Treat regulation as an engineering requirement, designing for auditability, evidence, data boundaries and jurisdictional variation from the start, and building the relationship with Compliance and Legal that lets us move quickly and safely.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hold responsible gaming and player integrity to the same product standard as any revenue-generating feature. Fans should be protected by systems that are accurate and timely, and that stay out of the way of people playing well within their means.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Simplify the estate you inherit. Retire duplicated capability, reduce coupling between teams and improve lead time to change, so the domain is easier to work in each quarter than it was the last.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set the standard for how AI is used across the software lifecycle in your teams, including where we choose not to use it, with evidence of the effect on throughput, quality and security and the judgment to tell real uplift from theatre.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Product, Compliance, Risk, Finance and Customer Operations to shape the roadmap early, so that capabilities are designed in at inception.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Make sure the right people are in the right jobs through hiring, development, performance management and creating leadership opportunities, and lead with empathy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Grow the managers and senior engineers who report to you, giving them the context and the scope to make decisions themselves rather than routing them through you.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Make sure the domain is supported properly in production, including on-call and incident response, and that corrective actions are completed rather than logged.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deliver architecturally sound solutions to complex problems, making considered build-versus-buy decisions and designing for scale, reliability and a multi-year horizon.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Communicate and progress strategic initiatives on a three to five year horizon covering platform evolution, money movement architecture and the shape of the domain.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be accountable for your budget, spend it carefully, and recognise waste in tooling, infrastructure, vendor services and payment processing costs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exemplify our company principles and support a culture of quality, candour and collaboration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;THE STATS&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;What we&#39;re looking for in our next teammate&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We don’t expect you necessarily to have all of these to apply but they all count.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;10+ years in a software role, with 5+ years leading engineering teams. Experience leading other managers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record of delivering and running high-volume transactional systems where correctness, money and customer trust are all at stake, ideally in payments, financial services, identity or another regulated domain.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with highly available, fault-tolerant systems under extreme, event-driven peak load, from design through to production support.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building on third parties at scale, for example payment service providers, KYC and identity vendors or geolocation suppliers, including the operational and commercial realities of those relationships.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable working in a regulated environment, where auditability, evidence and data boundaries shape the design.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with observability and with using data and KPIs to make engineering decisions and to hold a domain to a measurable standard of availability and performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep experience in modern back-end languages, functional and object-oriented, including Java, and with cloud infrastructure (preferably AWS), containers and orchestration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on understanding of AI-assisted software development, with a considered view of where it belongs in the lifecycle, where it does not, and what a regulated environment allows it to touch.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience defining and implementing software delivery practices and agile methods, with evidence of improving delivery pace while maintaining quality.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience supporting software systems in production, including on-call, with a sustained focus on improving their stability, availability and performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience delivering technology solutions with partner development teams through near-shore, off-shore or third-party arrangements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience designing and delivering technology for consumer-facing products in a fast-moving, ambiguous and closely scrutinised environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience defining and executing a strategic technical vision, and the communication skills to carry it with engineers and executives alike.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Degree in Computer Science, a related field, or equivalent practical experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;THE CONTRACT&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;We treat our team right&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Competitive compensation is just the beginning. As part of our team, you can expect:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An exciting and fun environment committed to driving real growth&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Opportunities to build really cool products that fans love&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mentorship and professional development resources to help you refine your game&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible vacation allowance to let you refuel&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hall of Fame benefit programs and platforms&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ABOUT FANDUEL&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;FanDuel Group is the premier mobile gaming company in the United States and Canada. FanDuel Group consists of a portfolio of leading brands across mobile wagering including: America’s #1 Sportsbook, FanDuel Sportsbook; its leading iGaming platform, FanDuel Casino; the industry’s unquestioned leader in horse racing and advance-deposit wagering, FanDuel Racing; and its daily fantasy sports product. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In addition, FanDuel Group operates FanDuel TV, its broadly distributed linear cable television network and FanDuel TV+, its leading direct-to-consumer OTT platform. FanDuel Group has a presence across all 50 states, Canada, and Puerto Rico.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The company is based in New York with US offices in Los Angeles, Atlanta, and Jersey City, as well as global offices in Canada and Scotland. The company’s affiliates have offices worldwide, including in Ireland, Portugal, Romania, and Australia.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;FanDuel Group is a subsidiary of Flutter Entertainment, the world&#39;s largest sports betting and gaming operator with a portfolio of globally recognized brands and traded on the New York Stock Exchange (NYSE: FLUT).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;img style=&quot;max-width: 100%;&quot; src=&quot;https://pages.8thlight.com/hubfs/Juan/New%20Careers%20Banner.svg&quot; alt=&quot;&quot; width=&quot;100%&quot;&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Principal Engineer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location&lt;/strong&gt;: Waterloo, London, England, UK | &lt;strong&gt;Hybrid&lt;/strong&gt; (1 day per week in office)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who We Are&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At 8th Light, we bring life to the best ideas.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Founded in 2006 and headquartered in Chicago, we are a technology solutions consultancy that partners with organisations from early-stage startups to the world&#39;s largest companies. We take on hard software challenges and turn them into durable results. We build agentic products, the platforms they run on, and the engineering and design at every layer.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our commitment to quality means we deliver solutions we’re truly proud of, while our curiosity sparks innovation and breakthrough thinking. 8th Lights thrive in an environment that champions continuous education, fueling our growth through mentorship and hands-on work. We foster an open, collaborative culture grounded in honesty that builds trust, and believe true success is measured by the outcomes we create for our clients.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If this kind of work and our kind of people energises you, you’ve found the right place.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who You Are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ve shown long-term repeated success on a variety of projects, typically over the course of 10+ years. You are a trusted expert and leader, often called upon to guide ambiguous initiatives and architect scalable solutions. You bring a blend of deep consulting acumen, technical expertise, and product thinking that drives measurable and impactful outcomes. In your previous experience, you have:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Built and shipped production-grade platforms: the reusable foundations, tools, infrastructure, and workflows that help other teams shift faster and more reliably&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Taken AI and agentic systems from prototype to production, with a strong understanding of infrastructure, authentication, and observability&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Delivered on&amp;nbsp; high-stakes consulting engagements across multiple language paradigms, stacks, ecosystems, and client industries&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Built high-quality, maintainable software collaboratively, incrementally, and through an approach tailored towards the unique needs of the clients you’ve served&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Led the development and delivery of production-grade software using a variety of languages and frameworks, including but not limited to: Java, C#/.NET, Python, TypeScript, JavaScript, React, Go, Ruby, Scala, R, and SQL&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Actively experimented with AI development tools and translated that experimentation into faster, higher-quality delivery for your teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record of understanding, assessing, and embracing new tooling and trends within the software industry&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Built or integrated AI/ML features into products and systems, including recommendation engines, NLP, computer vision, predictive analytics, RAG pipelines, and agents&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Successfully led modernisation and replatforming efforts to align legacy systems with short and long-term business needs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Led and delivered solutions to architecture-level problems including scalability, security, reliability, performance, maintainability, and observability&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Facilitated alignment across technical and non-technical stakeholders to move initiatives forward through ambiguity and complexity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provided mentorship and team support at scale, while sharing knowledge and improving team practices&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaboratively led stakeholders to balance technical considerations with product and user needs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Actively sought out and effectively given feedback&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Do At 8th Light&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a go-to technologist and strategist within 8th Light, you’ll work with a variety of clients, typically one to two in a year, while continuing to deepen your and our collective domain expertise over the course of your career with us. You’ll be responsible for:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Rapidly building trust with clients, demonstrating technical expertise and understanding of their domain and objectives&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Driving platform engineering work at the client level, connecting long-term technical vision to what ships&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leading platform strategy and delivery across diverse platform types, connecting long-term vision to what ships&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working pragmatically to balance technology choices while delivering high-quality work within deadlines&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advising clients on architecture, scalability and platform evolution, connecting technical decisions to product and business outcomes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborating on systems that involve the full ML lifecycle from data ingestion and preprocessing, to model deployment, integration, and performance monitoring&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Driving innovation by proactively surfacing new technical approaches and product solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leading or initiating formal feedback conversations with teams and clients via retrospectives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Clearly articulating and documenting outcomes and driving forward action items&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contributing to the health of your team and 8th Light’s culture by modeling our Values&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Designing and managing high-level technical roadmaps for large engagements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Building your network and maintaining relationships with clients and other industry leaders within your domain&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coaching client engineering teams, transferring knowledge and leveling up practices&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Influencing client CTOs and executive decisions. Planning and execute technical work that involves stakeholders outside of project boundaries such as across a client&#39;s technical organization&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with account teams on planning, opportunity identification, stakeholder relationships, and pre-sales scope shaping&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Facilitating retrospectives, strategy sessions, and technical deep-dives to improve team and project outcomes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identifying, mitigating, and resolving blockers to team progress&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contributing to 8th Light by serving as a mentor, leading or designing workshops internally or for clients, representing 8th Light in the tech community, or supporting our hiring processes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrating leadership in scalable system design, modular architecture, and platform- or product-oriented development&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bringing depth in testing strategies, observability, fault tolerance, and secure engineering practices&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Applying architectural patterns to evaluate tradeoffs and drive clear, documented design rationale&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strongly Preferred Skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We work across many areas, and encourage anyone with the experience listed above to apply. We would particularly like to encourage applicants with experience in the following areas:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Platform engineering: building reusable software foundations, internal developer platforms, and infrastructure that other teams build on&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Data Engineering: including platforms like Databricks for data processing and analytics&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Delivering production agentic systems, including RAG pipelines, vector search, and agentic frameworks such as LangChain, LlamaIndex, CrewAI, AutoGen, and n8n&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;DevSecOps &amp;amp; DevOps&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;MLOps&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Infrastructure as Code&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Building a truly diverse, equitable, and inclusive workplace is an ongoing journey, and we’re excited to keep learning and growing together. We have a proud tradition of hiring talented colleagues with real-world career experiences.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How You’ll be Supported&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At 8th Light, we believe our people are our greatest asset. Their growth, well-being, and success shape our future.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Our wellness package is designed with the Whole YOU in mind and includes:&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A robust L&amp;amp;D programme featuring unlimited access to thousands of books, courses, and expert-led training on the O&#39;Reilly learning platform.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Annual financial stipend and time allotment for learning &amp;amp; development&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coworking support for our global team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;12 weeks of new parent leave available for eligible employees&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;See our full list of &lt;a href=&quot;http://8thlight.com/benefits&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Benefits&lt;/a&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A Note on Compensation&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At 8th Light, we are committed to a compensation philosophy that is transparent, fair, and helps us attract and retain top talent in alignment with our company’s strategic growth goals and clients’ needs.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We benchmark our salaries using Geographic Structures to establish competitive pay ranges within the regions where 8th Lights live. Our pay ranges for our Principal Engineer position within London is: £92,818-£116,122 GBP&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Reach out to &lt;a ----- ----- for more relevant information pertaining to your local market.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;8th Light Hubs and Geographies&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;8th Light&#39;s culture is rooted in strong connections that extend across our teams, regions, and beyond client work. We are a distributed team across the United States, Canada, and the United Kingdom, with hubs in Chicago, London, Los Angeles, New York, and Seattle.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;London Co-working: &lt;/strong&gt;Employees working from our London hub follow a hybrid model, which includes a minimum of one day per week in our Waterloo Office. This co-working day is designed to encourage collaboration and further strengthen our community.In most cases, our consulting engagements do not require travel.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We hope to see you apply!&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;sup&gt;#LI-Hybrid&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h2 class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]&quot;&gt;A Note on Your Privacy&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]&quot;&gt;At 8th Light, one of our core values is&amp;nbsp;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Honesty that builds trust&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt; — and that shapes how we approach hiring. We want you to have a clear picture of &lt;em&gt;who we are&lt;/em&gt;, &lt;em&gt;what we&#39;re looking for&lt;/em&gt;, and &lt;em&gt;how we handle your information&lt;/em&gt; throughout the process.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]&quot;&gt;Before submitting your application, please take a moment to review our &lt;a class=&quot;underline underline underline-offset-2 decoration-1 decoration-current/40 hover:decoration-current focus:decoration-current&quot; href=&quot;https://8thlight.com/global-8th-light-candidate-privacy-notice&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Global Candidate Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;. By applying, you acknowledge that you&#39;ve read it.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;img style=&quot;max-width: 100%;&quot; src=&quot;https://pages.8thlight.com/hubfs/Juan/New%20Careers%20Banner.svg&quot; alt=&quot;&quot; width=&quot;100%&quot;&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead Engineer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location&lt;/strong&gt;: Waterloo, London, England, UK | &lt;strong&gt;Hybrid&lt;/strong&gt; (1 day per week in office)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who We Are&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At 8th Light, we bring life to the best ideas.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Founded in 2006 and headquartered in Chicago, we are a technology solutions consultancy that partners with organisations from early-stage startups to the world&#39;s largest companies. We take on hard software challenges and turn them into durable results. We build agentic products, the platforms they run on, and the engineering and design at every layer.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our commitment to quality means we deliver solutions we’re truly proud of, while our curiosity sparks innovation and breakthrough thinking. 8th Lights thrive in an environment that champions continuous education, fueling our growth through mentorship and hands-on work. We foster an open, collaborative culture grounded in honesty that builds trust, and believe true success is measured by the outcomes we create for our clients.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If this kind of work and our kind of people energises you, you’ve found the right place.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who You Are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ve shown long-term repeated success on a variety of projects, typically over the course of 7+ years. You can be the go-to leader for any software development engagement. You have a broad and deep range of expertise that allows you to make an immediate impact on projects. In your previous experience, you have:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Successfully led high-stakes consulting engagements from discovery to production&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Built high-quality, maintainable software collaboratively, incrementally, and through an approach tailored towards the unique needs of the clients you’ve served&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Written production-quality code using a variety of languages and frameworks, including but not limited to: Java, C#/.NET, Python, TypeScript, JavaScript, React, Go, Ruby, Scala, R, and SQL&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leveraged AI-assistive development tools for tasks like scaffolding, refactoring, debugging, test generation, and documentation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building or integrating AI/ML-powered features into products or systems (e.g., recommendation engines, NLP models, computer vision, predictive analytics)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Used context-appropriate automated testing to inform software design choices and catch bugs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Debugged and refactored pre-existing code to incrementally improve it&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborated with teams using Git, MacOS/Linux, and CI/CD&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Remedied architecture-level concerns such as scalability, security, reliability, and performance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Brought together people from different functions and perspectives in forums that encourage idea sharing, collaboration, and problem solving&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Made thoughtful recommendations and set direction in the face of ambiguity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mentored and shared knowledge with colleagues&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Actively sought out and effectively given feedback&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Communicated empathically with stakeholders and colleagues&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaboratively led stakeholders to balance technical considerations with product and user needs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Do At 8th Light&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a lead technologist on projects, you’ll work with a variety of clients, typically one to two in a year, through a variety of technologies and frameworks over the course of your career with us. You’ll lead more complicated projects, leading teams to do so. You’ll work with colleagues who share your passion for technology solutions. You’ll invest time developing your skills and sharing what you know. You’ll be responsible for:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Making immediate contributions to projects, rapidly building trust with clients&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working pragmatically to balance technology choices while delivering high-quality work within deadlines&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leading architecture and software design discussions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborating on systems that involve the full ML lifecycle from data ingestion and preprocessing, to model deployment, integration, and performance monitoring&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Generating new potential solutions to challenges (technical and non-technical) in partnership with team members and clients&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leading or initiating formal feedback conversations with teams and clients via retrospectives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Clearly articulating and documenting outcomes and driving forward action items&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contributing to the health of your team and 8th Light’s culture by modeling our Values&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensuring your team has a healthy, prioritized, estimated backlog&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Managing high-level project roadmaps as the team lead for large engagements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintaining relationships with client technical leaders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Regular syncs with the client to provide status updates, and for identifying and evaluating risks and presenting potential solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identifying, mitigating, and resolving blockers to team progress&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contributing to 8th Light by serving as a mentor, leading or designing workshops internally or for clients, representing 8th Light in the tech community, or supporting our hiring processes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strongly Preferred Skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We work across many areas, and encourage anyone with the experience listed above to apply. We would particularly like to encourage applicants with experience in the following areas:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Platform engineering: building reusable software foundations, internal developer platforms, and infrastructure that other teams build on&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Data Engineering: including platforms like Databricks for data processing and analytics&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Delivering production agentic systems, including RAG pipelines, vector search, and agentic frameworks such as LangChain, LlamaIndex, CrewAI, AutoGen, and n8n&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;DevSecOps &amp;amp; DevOps&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;MLOps&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Infrastructure as Code&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Building a truly diverse, equitable, and inclusive workplace is an ongoing journey, and we’re excited to keep learning and growing together. We have a proud tradition of hiring talented colleagues with real-world career experiences.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How You’ll be Supported&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At 8th Light, we believe our people are our greatest asset. Their growth, well-being, and success shape our future.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Our wellness package is designed with the Whole YOU in mind and includes:&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A robust L&amp;amp;D programme featuring unlimited access to thousands of books, courses, and expert-led training on the O&#39;Reilly learning platform.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Annual financial stipend and time allotment for learning &amp;amp; development&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coworking support for our global team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;12 weeks of new parent leave available for eligible employees&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;See our full list of&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;http://8thlight.com/benefits&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Benefits&lt;/a&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A Note on Compensation&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At 8th Light, we are committed to a compensation philosophy that is transparent, fair, and helps us attract and retain top talent in alignment with our company’s strategic growth goals and clients’ needs.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We benchmark our salaries using Geographic Structures to establish competitive pay ranges within the regions where 8th Lights live. Our pay ranges for our Lead Engineer position within London is: £76,023-95,029 GBP.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Reach out to ----- for more relevant information pertaining to your local market.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;8th Light Hubs and Geographies&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;8th Light&#39;s culture is rooted in strong connections that extend across our teams, regions, and beyond client work. We are a distributed team across the United States, Canada, and the United Kingdom, with hubs in Chicago, London, Los Angeles, New York, and Seattle.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;London Co-working: &lt;/strong&gt;Employees working from our London hub follow a hybrid model, which includes a minimum of one day per week in our Waterloo Office. This co-working day is designed to encourage collaboration and further strengthen our community.In most cases, our consulting engagements do not require travel.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We hope to see you apply!&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-Hybrid&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h2 class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]&quot;&gt;A Note on Your Privacy&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]&quot;&gt;At 8th Light, one of our core values is&amp;nbsp;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Honesty that builds trust&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt; — and that shapes how we approach hiring. We want you to have a clear picture of &lt;em&gt;who we are&lt;/em&gt;, &lt;em&gt;what we&#39;re looking for&lt;/em&gt;, and &lt;em&gt;how we handle your information&lt;/em&gt; throughout the process.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]&quot;&gt;Before submitting your application, please take a moment to review our &lt;a class=&quot;underline underline underline-offset-2 decoration-1 decoration-current/40 hover:decoration-current focus:decoration-current&quot; href=&quot;https://8thlight.com/global-8th-light-candidate-privacy-notice&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Global Candidate Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;. By applying, you acknowledge that you&#39;ve read it.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Cambridge, UK | Full-time | Permanent | Hybrid&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Salary: £75,000 to £95,000, DOE &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;About us&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Riverlane’s&amp;nbsp;mission is to master quantum error correction (QEC) and unlock a new age of human progress. From advances in material and climate science, to complex chemistry simulation for new drug design, quantum computers will help humanity solve some of its most important challenges. But without QEC, the industry’s defining technical challenge, such breakthroughs can never be achieved.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;Riverlane is the world leader in QEC technology. QEC is a complex problem that requires a range of skills,&amp;nbsp;talent&amp;nbsp;and passion.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW243923852 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW243923852 BCX8&quot;&gt;Having raised more than $125M in funding to date to accelerate our&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW243923852 BCX8&quot;&gt;cutting-edge&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW243923852 BCX8&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;R&amp;amp;D in quantum error correction (QEC), Riverlane partners with many of the world’s leading quantum hardware providers and government agencies to make fault-tolerant quantum computing a reality.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW243923852 BCX8&quot;&gt;We’re&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW243923852 BCX8&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;making remarkable progress and growing fast. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP SCXW243923852 BCX8&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;About the role&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for an exceptional Senior Product Manager with a background in science or engineering and quantum computing or HPC experience to help define and grow an important part of Riverlane’s software product portfolio.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is an early-stage, fast-moving area of our product roadmap: you’ll help shape its direction as much as run what already exists.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll sit right at the heart of this product area, working closely with users, partners and cross-functional teams to deeply understand real-world challenges and translate them into a compelling product direction. You’ll use a blend of user insight, product data and market context to cut through complexity and focus on what matters most.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll own and evolve the strategy and roadmap, bringing together engineering, research, business development and marketing around a shared vision, striking the balance between bold, long-term ambition and what’s realistically achievable today.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role sits close to the centre of Riverlane, working daily with colleagues across Engineering, Science and the PMO. We ask for three days a week in our Cambridge office to make that collaboration easy.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role involves quarterly travel, less than 10% of your time, to conferences such as IEEE and to visit customers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;What you will do&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the strategy and roadmap for your product area, balancing user needs, stakeholder input and Riverlane’s strategic direction&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Engage with customers, partners and internal teams to build a complete picture of market needs and the competitive landscape&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use product usage data, market insight and competitive analysis to prioritise features and drive adoption&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Align stakeholders across the C-suite, research, engineering, business development and marketing, and identify new market opportunities for Riverlane&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support go-to-market execution and launch readiness with Marketing and Business Development, including external collateral and documentation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor delivery progress and adapt plans as new challenges or opportunities emerge&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;What we need&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A background in engineering or science (degree or equivalent experience)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;4+ years in B2B product management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in a HPC or quantum computing, translating complex technical trade-offs into product decisions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High emotional intelligence, with strong active listening and critical thinking skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A collaborative, cross-functional team player who can influence without authority and build trust across teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ease with going technically deep, both internally and externally, to understand product capabilities and limitations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Someone who thrives in a fast-moving, ambiguous and rapidly evolving environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication, presentation and documentation skills, with the ability to tailor your style to different audiences&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A proactive mindset: you spot opportunities for improvement and act on them independently&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Willingness to travel occasionally (roughly quarterly, under 10% of your time) for conferences and customer visits&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Even better if you have…&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have experience with both hardware and software product management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have worked in a startup environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;What can you expect from us&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;22&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;A comprehensive benefits package that includes&amp;nbsp;an annual bonus plan,&amp;nbsp;private medical insurance, life insurance, and a&amp;nbsp;contributory pension scheme&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;22&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;2&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Equity, so that our team can share in the long-term success of Riverlane&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;22&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;3&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;28 days annual leave,&amp;nbsp;plus bank holidays and enhanced family leave&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;22&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;4&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;A diverse work environment that brings together experts in many fields (including software and hardware development, quantum information theory,&amp;nbsp;physics&amp;nbsp;and maths) and over 20 different nationalities&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;22&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;5&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;A learning environment that encourages individual, team and company growth and&amp;nbsp;development, including a regular programme of learning events and training and conference budgets&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;How to apply&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Please upload a CV and covering letter by clicking &#39;Apply&#39;. Your covering letter should explain why you are applying for the job and what skills and experience you can bring to the role.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;We review CVs as we receive them and interview as soon as we have applications that&amp;nbsp;look&amp;nbsp;like a good match. We do not use closing dates. So, please&amp;nbsp;apply as soon as possible to avoid&amp;nbsp;missing out on&amp;nbsp;this role.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;If you have any queries, please contact&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a ----- data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span ----- data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Hyperlink&quot;&gt;com&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:259}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:259}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Everyone is welcome at Riverlane. We are an equal opportunities employer and encourage applications from eligible and suitably qualified candidates regardless of age, disability, ethnicity, gender, gender reassignment, religion or belief, sexual orientation, marital or civil partnership status, or pregnancy and maternity/paternity.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Women and other underrepresented groups may be less likely to apply for a role unless they meet all or&amp;nbsp;nearly all&amp;nbsp;of the requirements.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;If this applies to you, we still encourage you to apply - you may be a great fit, even if you&amp;nbsp;don’t&amp;nbsp;meet every single qualification.&amp;nbsp;We’d&amp;nbsp;love to hear from you.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;If you need any adjustments made to the application or selection process so you can do your best, please let us know. We will be happy to help.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;GDPR notice: Riverlane collects and processes personal data in accordance with applicable data protection laws. If you are a European Job Applicant see the&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;a id=&quot;OWA843b0309-1485-8922-978c-b4a29d28b8a6&quot; class=&quot;x_x_fui-Link x_x____1q1shib x_x_f2hkw1w x_x_f3rmtva x_x_f1ewtqcl x_x_fyind8e x_x_f1k6fduh x_x_f1w7gpdv x_x_fk6fouc x_x_fjoy568 x_x_figsok6 x_x_f1s184ao x_x_f1mk8lai x_x_fnbmjn9 x_x_f1o700av x_x_f13mvf36 x_x_f1cmlufx x_x_f9n3di6 x_x_f1ids18y x_x_f1tx3yz7 x_x_f1deo86v x_x_f1eh06m1 x_x_f1iescvh x_x_fhgqx19 x_x_f1olyrje x_x_f1p93eir x_x_f1nev41a x_x_f1h8hb77 x_x_f1lqvz6u x_x_f10aw75t x_x_fsle3fq x_x_f17ae5zn x_x_OWAAutoLink&quot; href=&quot;https://riverlane.workable.com/gdpr_policy/v1?lang=en&quot; data-auth=&quot;NotApplicable&quot; data-linkindex=&quot;1&quot;&gt;privacy notice&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;for further details.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;Moonfare delivers what few others can: the highly sought-after funds and hidden-gem investments that go beyond what most private banks offer. Every opportunity is subjected to a ruthless vetting process; the bar is unforgivingly high. The result? Institutional-quality portfolios for investors who demand more.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our team combines finance veterans with talent from tech, consulting, law and industries you&#39;d never expect. Headquartered in Berlin, we operate from eight offices across Europe, the US and Asia.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you&#39;re ready to build what&#39;s next in private markets, let&#39;s talk.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;(Senior) Brand Designer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Moonfare is at an inflection point. We are 10 years in the making, with almost €4 billion in AUM and a new CMO recently in place, and the brand now carries more weight than it ever has. We are looking for a designer to make every surface we put in front of an investor look as though it was made on purpose.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The person you are designing for is a partner at Freshfields, a Goldman MD, the principal of a small family office. They read curated material every day and they notice slippage immediately. Our reference points are Loro Piana, Aman, Cartier and Hauser &amp;amp; Wirth — houses that wear their authority quietly and let the object carry the brand. We are a gallery rather than a supermarket, and the craft has to hold at that standard across a fund brochure, a thirty-two word invitation, a billboard at WEF and a single slide in a sales deck.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Brand Designer joins Moonfare&#39;s Marketing team — a high-output team responsible for building the brand, setting standards of excellence, generating demand, and driving investor acquisition across global markets. You will work daily with Fund Marketing, Investor Relations and Compliance, and you will own the craft rather than coordinate it. This role reports to the CMO.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;AI tooling is business as usual in this team — Claude and Figma in the daily stack. The gain we want is not speed for its own sake. It is your hours moving from the mechanical end of production to the thinking.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You Will:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the craft on every investor-facing surface — fund brochures, the annual letter, invitations, event environments, sales decks, web pages, paid assets — and hold the line on quality when the deadline argues otherwise.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tighten and maintain the design system: type, grid, colour, photography, motion and templates that let non-designers produce work which still looks like us.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design the fund marketing design system alongside Fund Marketing, so that each launch is assembled rather than reinvented, and the material reads like an LP memo rather than a brochure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Take long-form and content design seriously — due diligence summaries, research, the annual letter — where the job is clarity and restraint rather than decoration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design for physical objects and rooms as fluently as for screens: printed matter, direct mail, gifts, signage and event environments, GTM launches and private dinners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work inside compliance rather than around it, treating risk warnings and disclosures as a design problem to be solved properly.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bring an AI-first mindset to the production stack — concepting, variation, retouching, resizing and versioning — so that more of your time goes to the thinking and less to the mechanical.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Art-direct external partners including photographers, illustrators, agencies and printers, and brief them well enough that the output needs little rescuing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Next Moonfarian:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You bring six or more years of design experience, with a portfolio that shows editorial and brand craft rather than campaign volume.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have designed for a luxury house, a gallery or museum, a serious publication or a premium consumer brand — or you can show that you understand that register and want to work in it.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You bring an AI-native mindset — you use AI tools in your day-to-day and you have views on where they sharpen the work and where they flatten it.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are equally fluent in print and digital, and you have shipped physical work: something printed, bound, packaged or installed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You bring hands-on command of Figma and the Adobe suite&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You give feedback as well as take it, and you can explain a design decision to a non-designer without defensiveness or jargon.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You can work at pace inside a regulated industry and you see compliance as a design constraint rather than a blocker.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;This role is unlikely to be a good match if you:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Need a fully written brief before you can start. A good deal of this work begins as a conversation and a deadline.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prefer to direct rather than make. This is a hands-on role and the person in it designs every day.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Are happiest producing high volumes of performance creative. Our channel mix is deliberately narrow, and quality of execution matters more here than volume of message.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Find restraint frustrating rather than freeing. Our brand is built on hairline rules, whitespace and type weight rather than colour and ornament.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prefer to work at arm&#39;s length from the business. You will sit with Fund Marketing, Investor Relations and Compliance constantly.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Invest in Yourself:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ownership and Impact: &lt;/strong&gt;You are empowered to bring ideas, make decisions, and see your work directly contribute to Moonfare&#39;s success.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Transparent Environment: &lt;/strong&gt;We believe in open communication. You will receive regular updates on company strategy, performance against our KPIs, and key business decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Personal Growth: &lt;/strong&gt;We support your development with an individual growth budget of £1,500 or 2% of your base salary (whichever is higher).&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Invest in Your Future: &lt;/strong&gt;We support your long-term financial goals with a workplace pension via SmartPension, where Moonfare contributes 3% and combined employer and employee contributions reach at least 8%.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Relax and Recharge: &lt;/strong&gt;You start with 25 vacation days and you&#39;ll receive one additional day for each year of tenure, up to a maximum of 30 days. Moonfare gifts two days during our annual end of year company shutdown.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Daily Lunch: &lt;/strong&gt;Enjoy a £12 daily lunch allowance via Deliveroo on the days you&#39;re in the London office, delivered or ready to pick up nearby.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Fitness and Wellbeing: &lt;/strong&gt;Stay active with a subsidised FitnessFirst membership, with £30 covered by Moonfare each month and no joining fee, plus a monthly guest pass and company wellness events.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Health Cover:&lt;/strong&gt; Look after your health with private medical and dental cover through Bupa, including Select Complete Healthcare across 600 partner facilities and Dental Plan Level 2, with dependants covered up to age 24.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cycle to Work:&lt;/strong&gt; Ride in tax-efficiently through our salary-sacrifice scheme via Forest, available for an eBike or eMoped.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A Culture of Excellence:&lt;/strong&gt; Join a team of ambitious, smart, and committed professionals who are passionate about revolutionising private market investing.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Performance Reward: &lt;/strong&gt;As a performance-first company, we reward strong performance twice a year, so your impact translates directly into how your pay grows — through potential base salary increases and/or bonuses.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Values:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our clients come first, Moonfare comes second, and we prioritise ourselves third — Client-Centric Focus. &lt;/strong&gt;Putting clients first means creating value for them is essential. Placing Moonfare second signifies that our individual professional future at Moonfare depends on the company&#39;s commercial success. Prioritising ourselves third reflects our humility in putting clients and Moonfare before personal interests.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We pursue excellence and honor our promises — Commitment to Excellence. &lt;/strong&gt;We hold ourselves to the highest standards, taking responsibility for our failures, and celebrating our successes. We commit to deadlines and stick to them and we learn from our mistakes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We are here to win and to celebrate our collective achievements — Win together. &lt;/strong&gt;We are mission-focused and think and act like owners. We exemplify the attitude we expect and each of us commits to do what it takes to succeed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We foster personal growth but each of us earns our place as a Moonfarian through merit — Growth and Merit. &lt;/strong&gt;We hire, retain, and develop exceptional people and invest in empowering them to excel. We must all earn our place at the table every day.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Global Structure&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;Deliveroo is now part of DoorDash, bringing together teams with even greater reach, scale, and ambition. Depending on your role, you may collaborate with teammates, systems, and leaders across DoorDash and Wolt. Together, we’re unlocking new possibilities as one global team.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Deliveroo?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re building the definitive online food company, transforming the way the world eats by making hyper-local food more convenient and accessible. We obsess about building the future of food, whilst using our network as a force for good. We&#39;re at the forefront of an industry, powered by our market-leading technology and unrivalled network to bring incredible convenience and selection to our customers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Working at Deliveroo is the perfect environment to build a definitive career, motivated by impact. Firstly, the impact that working here will have on your development, allowing you to grow faster than you might elsewhere; secondly, the impact that you can have on Deliveroo, leaving your mark as we scale; and finally, being part of something bigger, through the impact that we make together in our marketplace and communities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We partner with some of the largest grocery retailers in the world, as well as a large number of small independent grocers.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In November 2023 we launched our non-food retail offering, Deliveroo ‘Shopping’, where we work with large and small merchants. We oversee all operations within the grocery and retail ecosystem, ensuring stores are equipped to receive and efficiently process orders. Our solutions empower stores to manage orders seamlessly through multiple channels, including our in-house app, API integration, and devices pre-installed with our software. Additionally, we provide tools to maintain and update product catalogs, ensuring accurate inventory for consumers. The technology we’ve developed enables our partners to pick the correct items swiftly while keeping inventory data current, optimizing both efficiency and accuracy.&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll do?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Software Engineer at Deliveroo, your individual work contributes to achieving goals in and across your team. While you will work with your team and you may lead projects, some of your work will contribute outside of your direct remit. You will report to managers and group leads and together deliver the results.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical Execution:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will improve code structure, have an impact on architecture, and review code of any scope produced by your team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll aim to simplify the maintenance and operation of production systems, visibility, operational readiness, and health of your team&#39;s systems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Collaboration &amp;amp; Leadership:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As well as leading from the front regarding technical execution, you&#39;ll build relationships with other engineering teams and, identify collaboration opportunities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll own larger pieces of work, assist with design and technical / implementation choices and influence the roadmap within your team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will take an active role in the hiring process and conducting engineering interviews. This will also extend to the current team where you will support the personal growth of colleagues, encouraging efficiency in their roles.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Expectations:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We want to emphasise that we don&#39;t expect you to meet all of the below but would love you to have experience in some of these areas.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Pride in readable, well-designed, well-tested software&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience writing web-based applications in any language, and an interest in learning (Go, Ruby/Rails, Python, Scala, or Rust)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience with relational databases (PostgreSQL, MySQL)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience with web architecture at scale (20krpm and above)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience with &quot;NoSQL&quot; data backends and other (Redis, DynamoDB, ElasticSearch, Memcache)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience solving logistical problems with software&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Why Join Us?&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Deliveroo, you’ll do work that matters—solving real-world problems in a three-sided marketplace that’s constantly evolving. We’re food lovers, problem solvers, community organisers, proud parents, and more, brought together by a shared drive to make things better. Working here you can expect to:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🔧 &lt;strong&gt;Solve meaningful problems at real scale&lt;/strong&gt; Work on a complex, always-on marketplace that impacts millions every day.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🌱 &lt;strong&gt;See your impact, fast&lt;/strong&gt; Ship, test and improve ideas quickly in a low-hierarchy, high-ownership environment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🧠 &lt;strong&gt;Grow through challenge and ownership&lt;/strong&gt; Take on big, ambiguous problems and accelerate your career with strong support.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🌎 &lt;strong&gt;A culture built for builders&lt;/strong&gt; High standards, collaboration, flexible working and continuous learning.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;💰 &lt;strong&gt;Share in the success you help create&lt;/strong&gt; Competitive salary and equity options, so you’re rewarded for the impact you make.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;➡️ Want a deeper look at how we build? Check out our &lt;a class=&quot;ng-star-inserted&quot; href=&quot;https://deliveroo.engineering&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Tech Blog&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We aim to create a fair process that lets your skills shine—our interview typically includes 3-4 stages. Explore our &lt;a class=&quot;ng-star-inserted&quot; href=&quot;https://careers.deliveroo.co.uk/interview-guide-for-engineers/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Engineering Interview Guide here&lt;/a&gt; to help you feel confident at each stage.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Our Global Structure&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Deliveroo is now part of DoorDash, bringing together teams with even greater reach, scale, and ambition. Depending on your role, you may collaborate with teammates, systems, and leaders across DoorDash and Wolt. Together, we’re unlocking new possibilities as one global team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Diversity, Equity and Inclusion&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Deliveroo, we know that a great workplace reflects the world around us and that true diversity and inclusion make us stronger, more creative, and better at what we do. We’re committed to fostering an environment where everyone can do their best work and feel they belong.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe in equality of opportunity and welcome candidates from all backgrounds regardless of age, gender, ethnicity, disability, sexual orientation, gender identity, socio-economic background, religion, or belief.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you have a disability or long-term health condition and need support to apply for one of our roles, or require any reasonable adjustments during the recruitment process, you’ll have the opportunity to let us know once you’ve submitted your application. We’ll share details on how to request support so we can ensure you have a fair and equitable experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you’re excited about making a real impact in a fast-moving marketplace and growing your career alongside ambitious, supportive teams, we’d love to hear from you!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Diversity, Equity and Inclusion&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;At Deliveroo, we know that a great workplace reflects the world around us and that true diversity and inclusion make us stronger, more creative, and better at what we do. We’re committed to fostering an environment where everyone can do their best work and feel they belong.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe in equality of opportunity and welcome candidates from all backgrounds regardless of age, gender, ethnicity, disability, sexual orientation, gender identity, socio-economic background, religion, or belief.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you have a disability or long-term health condition and need support to apply for one of our roles, or require any reasonable adjustments during the recruitment process, you’ll have the opportunity to let us know once you’ve submitted your application. We’ll share details on how to request support so we can ensure you have a fair and equitable experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you’re excited about making a real impact in a fast-moving marketplace and growing your career alongside ambitious, supportive teams, we’d love to hear from you!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;Beware of recruitment scams: DASH Brands will never ask you to pay money or share sensitive financial information during hiring — learn more about DASH Brands&#39; legitimate recruiting process at&lt;/em&gt; &lt;a class=&quot;_ymio1r31 _ypr0glyw _zcxs1o36 _mizu194a _1ah3dkaa _ra3xnqa1 _128mdkaa _1cvmnqa1 _4davt94y _4bfu18uv _1hms8stv _ajmmnqa1 _vchhusvi _kqswh2mm _2rkolb4i _ect4ttxp _syaz13af _1a3b18uv _4fpr8stv _5goinqa1 _f8pj13af _9oik18uv _1bnxglyw _jf4cnqa1 _30l313af _1nrm18uv _c2waglyw _1iohnqa1 _9h8h12zz _10531ra0 _1ien1ra0 _n0fx1ra0 _1vhv17z1&quot; href=&quot;http://careersatdoordash.com/recruitment-scam-awareness&quot; data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot; data-is-router-link=&quot;false&quot; data-testid=&quot;link-with-safety&quot;&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;careersatdoordash.com/recruitment-scam-awareness&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Global Structure&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;Deliveroo is now part of DoorDash, bringing together teams with even greater reach, scale, and ambition. Depending on your role, you may collaborate with teammates, systems, and leaders across DoorDash and Wolt. Together, we’re unlocking new possibilities as one global team.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Senior Software Engineer, Full Stack - New Verticals&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Join us in our mission to transform the way people shop and eat, where impact, innovation and growth drive everything we do. Our Engineering teams tackle complex technical challenges across a global, three-sided marketplace, building and scaling systems that serve millions of customers, riders and partners every day.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;From real-time logistics to resilient infrastructure and marketplace optimisation, we design, build and operate technology that powers Deliveroo’s growth at scale.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We partner with some of the largest grocery retailers in the world, as well as a large number of small independent grocers.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In November 2023 we launched our non-food retail offering, Deliveroo ‘Shopping’, where we work with large and small merchants. We oversee all operations within the grocery and retail ecosystem, ensuring stores are equipped to receive and efficiently process orders. Our solutions empower stores to manage orders seamlessly through multiple channels, including our in-house app, API integration, and devices pre-installed with our software. Additionally, we provide tools to maintain and update product catalogs, ensuring accurate inventory for consumers. The technology we’ve developed enables our partners to pick the correct items swiftly while keeping inventory data current, optimizing both efficiency and accuracy.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for a &lt;strong&gt;Senior Software Engineer - Full Stack&lt;/strong&gt; to join our &lt;strong&gt;London&lt;/strong&gt; team. In this role, you’ll help us build and scale seamless, high-performance features that span our entire stack, ensuring a world-class experience for our customers, partners, and riders.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Get to know our &lt;a class=&quot;ng-star-inserted&quot; href=&quot;https://careers.deliveroo.co.uk/software-engineering-at-deliveroo/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Engineering team&lt;/a&gt; — what drives us, how we work, and what you can expect.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What You’ll Be Doing&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role is based in our London office with a &lt;strong&gt;hybrid&lt;/strong&gt; setup, typically 3 days in the office.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Here’s what your day-to-day might look like:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive technical execution&lt;/strong&gt; by designing, building, and scaling backend services and frontend components that handle high-traffic workloads (20krpm and above).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead architectural improvements&lt;/strong&gt; and code reviews, ensuring the efficiency, visibility, and operational health of your team&#39;s systems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Partner with cross-functional disciplines&lt;/strong&gt; (PMs, Experience Designers) to plan projects, foresee dependencies, and mitigate technical risks.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Break down complex problems&lt;/strong&gt; into deliverable choices, influencing the roadmap and technical direction within your team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Support the growth of others&lt;/strong&gt; by mentoring colleagues and taking an active role in our engineering hiring process to build high-performing teams.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What You’ll Need to Thrive&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our ideal candidate will bring strong expertise in some of these areas and curiosity to grow in others:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Significant experience building web-based applications&lt;/strong&gt; in a modern stack; we use Go, Ruby, Python, and Scala, and we’re looking for someone keen to work across them.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Proven ability to design and operate web architecture at scale&lt;/strong&gt;, specifically with systems handling significant request volumes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Demonstrated ownership of relational databases&lt;/strong&gt; (PostgreSQL, MySQL) and experience with &quot;NoSQL&quot; backends such as Redis, DynamoDB, or Elasticsearch.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A commitment to software craft&lt;/strong&gt;, with a pride in writing readable, well-designed, and thoroughly tested code.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strong collaborative leadership skills&lt;/strong&gt;, with a track record of guiding implementation choices and supporting the personal growth of teammates.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Why Join Us?&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Deliveroo, you’ll do work that matters—solving real-world problems in a three-sided marketplace that’s constantly evolving. We’re food lovers, problem solvers, community builders and more, brought together by a shared drive to make things better. Working here you can expect to:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🔧 &lt;strong&gt;Solve meaningful problems at real scale&lt;/strong&gt; Work on a complex, always-on marketplace that impacts millions every day.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🌱 &lt;strong&gt;See your impact, fast&lt;/strong&gt; Ship, test and improve ideas quickly in a low-hierarchy, high-ownership environment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🧠 &lt;strong&gt;Grow through challenge and ownership&lt;/strong&gt; Take on big, ambiguous problems and accelerate your career with strong support.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🌎 &lt;strong&gt;A culture built for builders&lt;/strong&gt; High standards, collaboration, flexible working and continuous learning.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;💰 &lt;strong&gt;Share in the success you help create&lt;/strong&gt; Competitive salary and equity options, so you’re rewarded for the impact you make.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;➡️ Want a deeper look at how we build? Check out our &lt;a class=&quot;ng-star-inserted&quot; href=&quot;https://deliveroo.engineering&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Tech Blog&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We aim to create a fair process that lets your skills shine—our interview typically includes 3-4 stages. &lt;a class=&quot;ng-star-inserted&quot; href=&quot;https://careers.deliveroo.co.uk/interview-guide-for-engineers/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Explore our Engineering Interview Guide here&lt;/a&gt; to help you feel confident at each stage.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Diversity, Equity and Inclusion&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;At Deliveroo, we know that a great workplace reflects the world around us and that true diversity and inclusion make us stronger, more creative, and better at what we do. We’re committed to fostering an environment where everyone can do their best work and feel they belong.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe in equality of opportunity and welcome candidates from all backgrounds regardless of age, gender, ethnicity, disability, sexual orientation, gender identity, socio-economic background, religion, or belief.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you have a disability or long-term health condition and need support to apply for one of our roles, or require any reasonable adjustments during the recruitment process, you’ll have the opportunity to let us know once you’ve submitted your application. We’ll share details on how to request support so we can ensure you have a fair and equitable experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you’re excited about making a real impact in a fast-moving marketplace and growing your career alongside ambitious, supportive teams, we’d love to hear from you!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;Beware of recruitment scams: DASH Brands will never ask you to pay money or share sensitive financial information during hiring — learn more about DASH Brands&#39; legitimate recruiting process at&lt;/em&gt; &lt;a class=&quot;_ymio1r31 _ypr0glyw _zcxs1o36 _mizu194a _1ah3dkaa _ra3xnqa1 _128mdkaa _1cvmnqa1 _4davt94y _4bfu18uv _1hms8stv _ajmmnqa1 _vchhusvi _kqswh2mm _2rkolb4i _ect4ttxp _syaz13af _1a3b18uv _4fpr8stv _5goinqa1 _f8pj13af _9oik18uv _1bnxglyw _jf4cnqa1 _30l313af _1nrm18uv _c2waglyw _1iohnqa1 _9h8h12zz _10531ra0 _1ien1ra0 _n0fx1ra0 _1vhv17z1&quot; href=&quot;http://careersatdoordash.com/recruitment-scam-awareness&quot; data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot; data-is-router-link=&quot;false&quot; data-testid=&quot;link-with-safety&quot;&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;careersatdoordash.com/recruitment-scam-awareness&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Global Structure&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;Deliveroo is now part of DoorDash, bringing together teams with even greater reach, scale, and ambition. Depending on your role, you may collaborate with teammates, systems, and leaders across DoorDash and Wolt. Together, we’re unlocking new possibilities as one global team.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Join us in our mission to transform the way people shop and eat, where impact, innovation and growth drive everything we do. Our Analytics organisation sits at the heart of Deliveroo powering decision-making across product, commercial and operations through experimentation and causal inference.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for a &lt;strong&gt;Senior Data Scientist&lt;/strong&gt; to join our &lt;strong&gt;London&lt;/strong&gt; team (working hybrid, 3 days in the office). In this role, you’ll enable high-quality human-led decision-making to maximise impact.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re hiring multiple Senior Data Scientists across different areas of the business. Rather than hiring for one fixed team, we use the interview process to understand your strengths, interests and development areas, and then align you to the right scope, remit and team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Our Analytics Organisation&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We have an outstanding analytics organisation, with a mission to enable the highest quality human and machine decision-making.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our community is highly active, with guest lectures, study groups, mentorship programmes and a robust technical review process. Data Scientists can progress equally as technical leads or people managers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our data scientists come from all kinds of backgrounds but have excellence in common. Many are formally trained in data science, many are not.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Be Doing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will help answer questions like:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Which markets/cities should we enter next?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;How can we incentivise good rider behaviour?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;What is the impact of exclusive deals we have with restaurants?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;How do we optimise our compensation policy to keep our customers happy and ordering with Deliveroo?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;What are the trade-offs we face when choosing between growth and profitability? How should we decide between them?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;How much should our pricing vary by distance and by market?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;What is the optimum selection and variety of restaurants in a particular area?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;How do we adapt our consumer app to better suit grocery shoppers?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Need to Thrive&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Significant experience in Data Science (or similar) roles.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience leading both simple and more complex experiment designs, with the ability to proactively unpick insights to steer strategic decision making&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Great communication skills - in person, in writing, in code; to technical and non-technical audiences.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Through solid analysis, provide clear and actionable recommendations that influence the team&#39;s roadmap.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Effective problem-solving, demonstrating an ability to successfully address complex and ambiguous challenges.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ability to think creatively and insightfully about business problems&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Proficiency with analytical tools like R/Python and familiarity with SQL. Proficiency with Cursor/AI tools to deliver impactful, high-quality work efficiently is also valued&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A pragmatic, flexible approach, where you most care about achieving impact&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Excellent people skills — you&#39;ll be meeting with a range of both technical and non-technical stakeholders to translate business needs into data science problems&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Join Us?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Deliveroo, you’ll do work that matters, solving real-world problems in a three-sided marketplace that’s constantly evolving. We’re food lovers, problem solvers, community builders and more, brought together by a shared drive to make things better. Working here you can expect to:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🔧 &lt;strong&gt;Solve meaningful problems at real scale&lt;/strong&gt; Work on a complex, always-on marketplace that impacts millions every day.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🌱 &lt;strong&gt;See your impact, fast&lt;/strong&gt; Ship, test and improve ideas quickly in a low-hierarchy, high-ownership environment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🧠 &lt;strong&gt;Grow through challenge and ownership&lt;/strong&gt; Take on big, ambiguous problems and accelerate your career with strong support.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🌎 &lt;strong&gt;A culture built for builders&lt;/strong&gt; High standards, collaboration, flexible working and continuous learning.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;​​💰 &lt;strong&gt;Share in the success you help create&lt;/strong&gt; Competitive salary and equity options, so you’re rewarded for the impact you make.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We aim to create a fair process that lets your skills shine—our interview typically includes 3-4 stages. Find more about&lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.deliveroo.co.uk/how-we-hire/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt; &lt;u&gt;how we hire here&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Diversity, Equity and Inclusion&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;At Deliveroo, we know that a great workplace reflects the world around us and that true diversity and inclusion make us stronger, more creative, and better at what we do. We’re committed to fostering an environment where everyone can do their best work and feel they belong.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe in equality of opportunity and welcome candidates from all backgrounds regardless of age, gender, ethnicity, disability, sexual orientation, gender identity, socio-economic background, religion, or belief.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you have a disability or long-term health condition and need support to apply for one of our roles, or require any reasonable adjustments during the recruitment process, you’ll have the opportunity to let us know once you’ve submitted your application. We’ll share details on how to request support so we can ensure you have a fair and equitable experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you’re excited about making a real impact in a fast-moving marketplace and growing your career alongside ambitious, supportive teams, we’d love to hear from you!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;Beware of recruitment scams: DASH Brands will never ask you to pay money or share sensitive financial information during hiring — learn more about DASH Brands&#39; legitimate recruiting process at&lt;/em&gt; &lt;a class=&quot;_ymio1r31 _ypr0glyw _zcxs1o36 _mizu194a _1ah3dkaa _ra3xnqa1 _128mdkaa _1cvmnqa1 _4davt94y _4bfu18uv _1hms8stv _ajmmnqa1 _vchhusvi _kqswh2mm _2rkolb4i _ect4ttxp _syaz13af _1a3b18uv _4fpr8stv _5goinqa1 _f8pj13af _9oik18uv _1bnxglyw _jf4cnqa1 _30l313af _1nrm18uv _c2waglyw _1iohnqa1 _9h8h12zz _10531ra0 _1ien1ra0 _n0fx1ra0 _1vhv17z1&quot; href=&quot;http://careersatdoordash.com/recruitment-scam-awareness&quot; data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot; data-is-router-link=&quot;false&quot; data-testid=&quot;link-with-safety&quot;&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;careersatdoordash.com/recruitment-scam-awareness&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Global Structure&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;Deliveroo is now part of DoorDash, bringing together teams with even greater reach, scale, and ambition. Depending on your role, you may collaborate with teammates, systems, and leaders across DoorDash and Wolt. Together, we’re unlocking new possibilities as one global team.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2 data-path-to-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Senior Global Advertising Manager&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;1&quot;&gt;​​Join us in our mission to transform the way people shop and eat, where impact, innovation, and growth drive everything we do. Our Advertising team sits at the intersection of commerce, data and marketing helping restaurant and grocery partners accelerate growth through smart, insight-led media solutions. From shaping high-impact campaign strategies to optimising performance at scale, we combine commercial acumen with deep marketplace insight to unlock value for our partners while driving sustainable revenue growth for Deliveroo.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;2&quot;&gt;We’re looking for a Senior Global Advertising Manager to join our London team. This is a hybrid role. In this role, you’ll help us craft and execute advertising strategies that exceed the needs of our restaurant partners and drive quarterly growth, both directly with key partners and at scale through enabling and leading global commercial teams.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 data-path-to-node=&quot;4&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Be Doing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;5&quot;&gt;You’ll be joining the Ads and Account Management team. We focus on building deep partnerships, enabling commercial teams, and crafting tailored media strategies to accelerate partner growth across our marketplace.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;6&quot;&gt;Here’s what your day-to-day might look like:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-path-to-node=&quot;7&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;7,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;7,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Identify Data-Led Opportunities:&lt;/strong&gt; Proactively identify scope to increase advertising penetration and spend using a combination of data analytics and commercial insight.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;7,1,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;7,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Develop Processes &amp;amp; Go-To-Market Programs:&lt;/strong&gt; Originating programs and reporting frameworks that organise commercial teams behind key opportunities to track progress effectively.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;7,2,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;7,2,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Enable Teams &amp;amp; Build Playbooks:&lt;/strong&gt; Build playbooks, training, and go-to-market materials that equip global commercial and account management teams to maximise advertising revenue.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;7,3,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;7,3,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;People &amp;amp; Team Leadership:&lt;/strong&gt; Manage, coach, and support team members, setting clear goals and fostering a culture of high performance and professional growth.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;7,4,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;7,4,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Partner Strategy &amp;amp; Campaign Management:&lt;/strong&gt; Work directly with major restaurant partners to understand marketing objectives, propose tailored ad solutions, and coordinate campaign launches, management, and reporting.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;7,5,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;7,5,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Performance Monitoring &amp;amp; Optimisation:&lt;/strong&gt; Proactively monitor campaign performance, identifying, communicating, and resolving any issues to exceed partner objectives.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;7,6,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;7,6,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Shape Product Solutions:&lt;/strong&gt; Act as the voice of our partners to feed structured feedback back into internal teams, informing how we iterate and build improved advertising and reporting products.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 data-path-to-node=&quot;9&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Need to Thrive&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h3 data-path-to-node=&quot;10&quot;&gt;Essential&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul data-path-to-node=&quot;11&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;11,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;11,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Commercial Advertising Experience:&lt;/strong&gt; Significant experience in commercially focused roles, with a strong background in performance advertising or account management.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;11,1,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;11,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;People Leadership &amp;amp; Management:&lt;/strong&gt; Proven ability to manage, coach, and develop team members, driving high engagement and performance against commercial targets.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;11,2,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;11,2,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Strategy &amp;amp; Process Scaling:&lt;/strong&gt; Demonstrated capability in defining, launching, and scaling go-to-market strategies and operational processes across teams.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;11,3,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;11,3,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Stakeholder Management:&lt;/strong&gt; Exceptional relationship-building skills with a proven ability to work effectively and build trusted relationships with multiple internal and external partners.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;11,4,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;11,4,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Analytical &amp;amp; Innovative Thinking:&lt;/strong&gt; Highly analytical mindset with strong capability to interpret data and turn findings into strategic commercial recommendations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 data-path-to-node=&quot;12&quot;&gt;Nice to Have&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul data-path-to-node=&quot;13&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;13,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;13,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Digital Marketing &amp;amp; Marketplace Experience:&lt;/strong&gt; Prior exposure to digital marketing environments, e-commerce, or aggregator platforms.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 data-path-to-node=&quot;15&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Join Us?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;16&quot;&gt;At Deliveroo, you’ll do work that matters, solving real-world problems in a three-sided marketplace that’s constantly evolving. We’re food lovers, problem solvers, community builders and more, brought together by a shared drive to make things better. Working here you can expect to:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;17&quot;&gt;🔧 &lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;17&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;3&quot;&gt;Make a visible impact every day&lt;/strong&gt; Your work directly improves experiences for customers, partners and riders.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;18&quot;&gt;🌱 &lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;18&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;3&quot;&gt;Learn fast in an entrepreneurial environment&lt;/strong&gt; Work close to the market with autonomy, pace and real responsibility.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;19&quot;&gt;🧠 &lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;19&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;3&quot;&gt;Build a career, not just a role&lt;/strong&gt; Stretch yourself, develop new skills and grow as the business evolves.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;20&quot;&gt;🌎 &lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;20&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;3&quot;&gt;Deliver together in an inclusive culture&lt;/strong&gt; Collaborative, values-driven teams that support how you work best.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p id=&quot;p-rc_eedd860bc4ce1e7d-100&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;21&quot;&gt;We aim to create a fair process that lets your skills shine—our &lt;span class=&quot;citation-394 citation-395 citation-end-395&quot;&gt;interview typically includes 3-4 stages. Find more about how we hire here.&lt;sup class=&quot;superscript&quot; data-turn-source-index=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;citation-394 citation-end-394&quot;&gt;&lt;sup class=&quot;superscript&quot; data-turn-source-index=&quot;2&quot;&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 data-path-to-node=&quot;21&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;citation-392 citation-393 citation-end-393&quot;&gt;Our Global Structure&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;21&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;citation-392 citation-393 citation-end-393&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;citation-390 citation-391 citation-end-391&quot;&gt;Deliveroo is now part of DoorDash, bringing together teams with even greater reach, scale, and ambition. Depending on your role, you may collaborate with teammates, systems, and leaders across Do&lt;sup class=&quot;superscript&quot; data-turn-source-index=&quot;5&quot;&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;citation-390 citation-end-390&quot;&gt;orDash and Wolt. Together,&lt;sup class=&quot;superscript&quot; data-turn-source-index=&quot;6&quot;&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt; we’re &lt;span class=&quot;citation-389 citation-end-389&quot;&gt;unlocking new possibilities as one global team.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;source-inline-chip-container luminous-sources ng-star-inserted&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;p-rc_eedd860bc4ce1e7d-101&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;22&quot;&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Diversity, Equity and Inclusion&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;At Deliveroo, we know that a great workplace reflects the world around us and that true diversity and inclusion make us stronger, more creative, and better at what we do. We’re committed to fostering an environment where everyone can do their best work and feel they belong.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe in equality of opportunity and welcome candidates from all backgrounds regardless of age, gender, ethnicity, disability, sexual orientation, gender identity, socio-economic background, religion, or belief.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you have a disability or long-term health condition and need support to apply for one of our roles, or require any reasonable adjustments during the recruitment process, you’ll have the opportunity to let us know once you’ve submitted your application. We’ll share details on how to request support so we can ensure you have a fair and equitable experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you’re excited about making a real impact in a fast-moving marketplace and growing your career alongside ambitious, supportive teams, we’d love to hear from you!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;Beware of recruitment scams: DASH Brands will never ask you to pay money or share sensitive financial information during hiring — learn more about DASH Brands&#39; legitimate recruiting process at&lt;/em&gt; &lt;a class=&quot;_ymio1r31 _ypr0glyw _zcxs1o36 _mizu194a _1ah3dkaa _ra3xnqa1 _128mdkaa _1cvmnqa1 _4davt94y _4bfu18uv _1hms8stv _ajmmnqa1 _vchhusvi _kqswh2mm _2rkolb4i _ect4ttxp _syaz13af _1a3b18uv _4fpr8stv _5goinqa1 _f8pj13af _9oik18uv _1bnxglyw _jf4cnqa1 _30l313af _1nrm18uv _c2waglyw _1iohnqa1 _9h8h12zz _10531ra0 _1ien1ra0 _n0fx1ra0 _1vhv17z1&quot; href=&quot;http://careersatdoordash.com/recruitment-scam-awareness&quot; data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot; data-is-router-link=&quot;false&quot; data-testid=&quot;link-with-safety&quot;&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;careersatdoordash.com/recruitment-scam-awareness&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Global Structure&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;Deliveroo is now part of DoorDash, bringing together teams with even greater reach, scale, and ambition. Depending on your role, you may collaborate with teammates, systems, and leaders across DoorDash and Wolt. Together, we’re unlocking new possibilities as one global team.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Data &amp;amp; Science Org&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Deliveroo we have an outstanding data science organisation, with a mission to enable the highest quality human and machine decision-making. We work throughout the company - in product, business and platform teams - using analysis, experimentation, causal inference and machine learning techniques. We are uniquely placed to use data to help make better decisions and improve data literacy across Deliveroo.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Data Scientists at Deliveroo report into our data science management team, and we have a highly active data science community, with guest lecturers, study groups, mentorship programmes, a robust technical review process, and plenty of opportunities to learn new things. Data Scientists can equally progress as technical leads (individual contributors) and as people managers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our data scientists come from all kinds of backgrounds but have excellence in common. Many are formally trained in data science, many are not. We celebrate difference and have a dedicated data science diversity committee.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As an Economist at Deliveroo you will help scale our business and improve the experience for restaurants, riders, and eaters. Using experimental or observational data, you will get to help answer questions like:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Which markets/cities should we enter next?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;How can we incentivise good rider behaviour?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;What is the business impact of exclusive deals we have with restaurants?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Can the Delivery food market sustain multiple players?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;What are the trade-offs we face when choosing between growth and profitability? How should we decide between them?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;What is the optimum selection and variety of restaurants?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;What impact do online reviews have?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;How will a change in the user interface affect customer choice behaviour?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The work you will do will have a direct, measurable impact on the bottom line of the company.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Requirements:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Masters Degree or PhD in Economics or Econometrics (preferred)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Always curious and willing to learn new skills&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A problem solver with a deep analytical mindset&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ability to think creatively and insightfully about business-relevant economic problems&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A critical thinker with very strong attention to detail&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Proficiency with analytical tools like R/Python and familiarity with SQL&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ideally industry experience since the completion of your academic career&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Excellent people skills — you’ll be meeting with stakeholders to translate business needs into economic problems&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Deliveroo these are just some of the tough problems we are solving - and there is no challenge that cannot be yours. The scope for growth and personal impact is enormous.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Deliveroo&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Our mission is to transform the way you shop and eat, bringing the neighbourhood to your door by connecting consumers, restaurants, shops and riders. We are transforming the way the world eats and shops by making access to food and products more convenient and enjoyable. We give people the opportunity to buy what they want, as they want it, when and where they want it.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are a technology-driven company at the forefront of the most rapidly expanding industry in the world. We are still a small team, making a very large impact, looking to answer some of the most interesting questions out there. We move fast, value autonomy and ownership, and we are always looking for new ideas.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Workplace &amp;amp; Benefits&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;At Deliveroo we know that people are the heart of the business and we prioritise their welfare. Benefits differ by country, but we offer many benefits in areas including healthcare, well-being, parental leave, pensions, and generous annual leave allowances, including time off to support a charitable cause of your choice. Benefits are country-specific, please ask your recruiter for more information.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Diversity, Equity and Inclusion&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;At Deliveroo, we know that a great workplace reflects the world around us and that true diversity and inclusion make us stronger, more creative, and better at what we do. We’re committed to fostering an environment where everyone can do their best work and feel they belong.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe in equality of opportunity and welcome candidates from all backgrounds regardless of age, gender, ethnicity, disability, sexual orientation, gender identity, socio-economic background, religion, or belief.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you have a disability or long-term health condition and need support to apply for one of our roles, or require any reasonable adjustments during the recruitment process, you’ll have the opportunity to let us know once you’ve submitted your application. We’ll share details on how to request support so we can ensure you have a fair and equitable experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you’re excited about making a real impact in a fast-moving marketplace and growing your career alongside ambitious, supportive teams, we’d love to hear from you!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;Beware of recruitment scams: DASH Brands will never ask you to pay money or share sensitive financial information during hiring — learn more about DASH Brands&#39; legitimate recruiting process at&lt;/em&gt; &lt;a class=&quot;_ymio1r31 _ypr0glyw _zcxs1o36 _mizu194a _1ah3dkaa _ra3xnqa1 _128mdkaa _1cvmnqa1 _4davt94y _4bfu18uv _1hms8stv _ajmmnqa1 _vchhusvi _kqswh2mm _2rkolb4i _ect4ttxp _syaz13af _1a3b18uv _4fpr8stv _5goinqa1 _f8pj13af _9oik18uv _1bnxglyw _jf4cnqa1 _30l313af _1nrm18uv _c2waglyw _1iohnqa1 _9h8h12zz _10531ra0 _1ien1ra0 _n0fx1ra0 _1vhv17z1&quot; href=&quot;http://careersatdoordash.com/recruitment-scam-awareness&quot; data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot; data-is-router-link=&quot;false&quot; data-testid=&quot;link-with-safety&quot;&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;careersatdoordash.com/recruitment-scam-awareness&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Global Structure&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;Deliveroo is now part of DoorDash, bringing together teams with even greater reach, scale, and ambition. Depending on your role, you may collaborate with teammates, systems, and leaders across DoorDash and Wolt. Together, we’re unlocking new possibilities as one global team.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Join us to redefine the future of on-demand delivery. To do this, we&#39;re building a world-class Finance Engineering (FinEng) organization across all global markets we support at DoorDash, Deliveroo and Wolt. in which each of our product managers plays a critical role in helping to define and execute our vision to move money accurately and at scale across every market we operate in and ensure finance and accounting compliance. As we grow, billions of dollars in money movements flow through our platform every year and our team makes sure every one of them is understood, trusted, and correctly reflected in the financial books.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;About the Role&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Product Managers on the Finance Engineering team need a systems-oriented mindset, platform thinking, and strong cross-functional collaboration. In this role, you will define the strategy and vision for systems that track billions of dollars in company-wide money movement, translate transactions into accounting entries, and accelerate the financial close. You will build scalable, audit-ready automation for complex, high-volume financial activity.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is an opportunity to reshape modern accounting by applying AI to reconciliation, investigations, and incident detection and mitigation. Your products will form a critical part of the company’s financial infrastructure and help earn the confidence of leadership, auditors, and regulators.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;You&#39;re excited about this opportunity because you will…&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive the product definition, strategy, and long-term vision for accounting automation. You own the roadmap&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build systems that track billion-dollar-level money movements across the entire company and automatically convert them into accurate accounting entries&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Reinvent and accelerate the accounting close process, reducing manual effort and shortening close timelines&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Champion AI-driven approaches to transform close reconciliation, financial investigations, and incident detection and mitigation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with FinEng, Accounting, and Finance leaders to translate complex financial and regulatory requirements into scalable, automated products&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with cross-functional teams of engineers, designers, data scientists, accountants, and operators&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Communicate product plans, benefits, and results to key stakeholders including the leadership team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;We&#39;re excited about you because…&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have a track record in product management, including driving product strategy, vision, and roadmap alignment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have built complex, back-end, data-intensive, or platform products. Ideally in fintech, payments, accounting, or financial systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have a strong grasp of accounting concepts (e.g. double-entry, ledgers, reconciliations, the close process) and how financial data flows through complex system&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You do your best work with range: global platform thinking alongside the accounting reality of a specific brand or market&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You&#39;re an execution power-house who thrives in ambiguity and operates at the lowest level of detai&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are excited about applying AI/ML to real-world financial problems such as reconciliation, investigation, and incident mitigation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have experience presenting business reviews to senior executives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have empathy for the users you build for, including accountants, controllers, and finance operators&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are motivated by building financial infrastructure that works across DoorDash, Deliveroo, and Wolt&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Why Join Us?&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Deliveroo, you’ll do work that matters, solving real-world problems in a three-sided marketplace that’s constantly evolving. We’re food lovers, problem solvers, community builders and more, brought together by a shared drive to make things better. Working here you can expect to:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🔧 Solve meaningful problems at real scale Work on a complex, always-on marketplace that impacts millions every day.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🌱 See your impact, fast Ship, test and improve ideas quickly in a low-hierarchy, high-ownership environment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🧠 Grow through challenge and ownership Take on big, ambiguous problems and accelerate your career with strong support.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🌎 A culture built for builders High standards, collaboration, flexible working and continuous learning. 💰 Share in the success you help create Competitive salary and equity options, so you’re rewarded for the impact you make.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;➡️ Want a deeper look at how we build? Check out our Tech Blog. We aim to create a fair process that lets your skills shine—our interview typically includes 3-4 stages. Find more about how we hire here.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Diversity, Equity and Inclusion&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;At Deliveroo, we know that a great workplace reflects the world around us and that true diversity and inclusion make us stronger, more creative, and better at what we do. We’re committed to fostering an environment where everyone can do their best work and feel they belong.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe in equality of opportunity and welcome candidates from all backgrounds regardless of age, gender, ethnicity, disability, sexual orientation, gender identity, socio-economic background, religion, or belief.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you have a disability or long-term health condition and need support to apply for one of our roles, or require any reasonable adjustments during the recruitment process, you’ll have the opportunity to let us know once you’ve submitted your application. We’ll share details on how to request support so we can ensure you have a fair and equitable experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you’re excited about making a real impact in a fast-moving marketplace and growing your career alongside ambitious, supportive teams, we’d love to hear from you!&lt;/p&gt;
