&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Introduction&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;At Cambridge Consultants we are on a mission to use deep tech to transform business, society and the planet. As our business continues to grow, we are seeking to expand our Sustainability team with an intern who has relevant environmental science expertise.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;The placement will last for 12 months. &lt;strong&gt;Successful candidates should be available to start between May - October 2027.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;The role provides experience within a multidisciplinary environment and offers the opportunity to build close working relationships with deep technical specialists, designers, strategy consultants and engineers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;There is no deadline for this role, as we recruit on a rolling basis. Once the position is filled, we will close the advert. We encourage you to apply as soon as possible.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we can offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;This role involves contributing to real advisory and technology development projects for clients facing technology challenges related to net zero, climate resilience, or environmental regulations. Cambridge Consultants conducts an extraordinary breadth of projects, and you may also have the opportunity to apply your skills and environmental science expertise to projects beyond those with a core sustainability focus.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;Some of your responsibilities will include:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-spread=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contributing to real client projects, applying your skills to sustainability challenges across sectors such as energy transition, telecoms, healthcare, and the built environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Supporting analysis, prototyping, and the communication of multidisciplinary solutions that deliver measurable environmental or social impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working across disciplines, collaborating with engineers, scientists, designers, and domain experts to represent environmental and social impacts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Presenting findings and ideas clearly to both technical and non-technical audiences, including drafting content for reports, producing diagrams, and building PowerPoint presentations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participating in internal communities of practice and contributing to our growing knowledge base in this area.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you can bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;We are looking for someone studying towards a degree in a relevant subject, such as Environmental Science, Atmospheric Science, Geophysics, Earth Sciences, or Physical Geography. We encourage you to apply if you are studying a related degree that is not listed here but covers similar content.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;You’re someone who:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-spread=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Has an interest in the use of technology to solve climate challenges.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Communicates effectively and enjoys working as part of a team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Is passionate about current technology and stays up to date with new developments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enjoys conducting secondary research to learn about topics outside their core focus area.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;Developing innovative and imaginative solutions requires an inquisitive approach and a willingness to tackle complex problems. You should be keen to learn new skills and be open to new approaches. Good oral and written communication skills will be key to interacting effectively within Cambridge Consultants and with our clients’ organisations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;Experience with any of the following would be advantageous, though not essential:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-spread=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on prototyping of physical or digital systems. This could be in a personal capacity, such as building computer games or websites, or through crafts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;By submitting an application to Cambridge Consultants, you confirm that the information provided in this application, together with any supporting documentation, is true, complete, and accurate to the best of your knowledge and belief. You understand that any false statement, misleading information, or material omission may render you liable to disqualification from the recruitment process, withdrawal of any offer of employment, or dismissal without notice if discovered following appointment. You acknowledge that the organisation reserves the right to verify the information supplied.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Overview&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559737&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:278}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Are you naturally curious about how things work and what might happen if you&amp;nbsp;think outside the box? If coding and technical challenges excite you, a 12-month internship in software testing could be the perfect opportunity to channel your curiosity. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; We&#39;re&amp;nbsp;seeking a&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Software Test Engineering Intern&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; to help develop test solutions for complex wireless systems and products. Working closely with both test and development teams, you’ll receive hands-on support and guidance, allowing you to explore new products and domains. You’ll be involved in designing and creating tests to thoroughly assess products under development, often operating at the intersection of electronics and software.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Successful candidates can join us between May- October 2027.  &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;There is no deadline for this role, as we recruit on a rolling basis. Once the position is filled, we will close the advert. We encourage you to apply as soon as possible.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;About the Test&amp;nbsp;Department&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Cambridge Consultants is a world leader in wireless communications, with one of the largest independent wireless development teams in the world. &amp;nbsp;The markets that we address include telecommunications, healthcare, industrial, satellite, consumer and automotive. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;As a test engineer, you will become aware of all forms of testing. You&amp;nbsp;don’t&amp;nbsp;have to know how to do all of them, but need to appreciate what is&amp;nbsp;required, be willing to learn new skills and coordinate getting it done. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;You will work with a team who&amp;nbsp;collaborates with other disciplines to test&amp;nbsp;cutting-edge&amp;nbsp;software, hardware, and end-to-end systems.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Our group handles test planning, design, and testing for products across sectors, which includes building custom automation tools (primarily in Python) and developing continuous integration and deployment pipelines. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;You will have the opportunity to work on ground-breaking wireless designs, for example: &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;1&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;multilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.cambridgeconsultants.com/project/wireless-breakthrough-for-the-ocado-smart-platform/&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Hyperlink&quot;&gt;Ocado Smart Platform, transforming online grocery across the world&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;2&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;multilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.cambridgeconsultants.com/project/the-first-truly-global-push-to-talk-satellite-phone-for-iridium/&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Hyperlink&quot;&gt;Iridium Extreme satellite phone, the first truly global ‘push-to-talk’ mobile communications system&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;What&amp;nbsp;you&#39;ll&amp;nbsp;be doing  &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW245929320 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-GB&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW245929320 BCX8&quot;&gt;With lots of support from our collaborative team,&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW245929320 BCX8&quot;&gt;you’ll&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW245929320 BCX8&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;be involved in:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP SCXW245929320 BCX8&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559737&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:278}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;3&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;multilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Scoping and designing test activities, often for multiple projects at a time. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;4&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;multilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Creating test scripts,&amp;nbsp;assisting&amp;nbsp;with the development of bespoke test harnesses, and&amp;nbsp;maintaining&amp;nbsp;DevOps environments. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;5&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;multilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Delivering high-quality code that meets our internal standards. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
