&lt;li data-uuid=&quot;35a921d4-d366-45a2-b3c3-247b7b71bae6&quot;&gt;21 annual vacation days, additional days based on tenure, plus&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;4 extra global VeeaMe Days for self-care and 24 paid volunteer hours annually through Veeam Cares&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-uuid=&quot;a1803b2a-2448-4c70-9589-77af2b81af42&quot;&gt;Private health, dental, and vision insurance for employees and dependents, including outpatient care, hospitalization, pregnancy monitoring, and psychology support&lt;/li&gt;
