&lt;h2 class=&quot;s-pb-2 s-pt-4 s-heading-xl s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night&quot;&gt;1. The Team You&#39;ll Join&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;s-whitespace-pre-wrap s-break-words s-font-normal first:s-pt-0 last:s-pb-0 s-py-1 @md:s-pt-2 @md:s-pb-[10px] @md:s-leading-relaxed s-text-base s-leading-relaxed s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night&quot;&gt;You&#39;ll be part of our EMEA Brand Design team led by Gavin Jones, Brand Design Manager. The team consists of 3 people, including this internship role, working closely with the wider Marketing organisation across the region. Together, you&#39;ll be bringing Mirakl&#39;s visual identity to life — crafting compelling, on-brand assets that support campaigns, drive awareness, and strengthen how we show up across digital and print channels.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;s-whitespace-pre-wrap s-break-words s-font-normal first:s-pt-0 last:s-pb-0 s-py-1 @md:s-pt-2 @md:s-pb-[10px] @md:s-leading-relaxed s-text-base s-leading-relaxed s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&quot;This is a hands-on team where you&#39;ll be involved from day one. I&#39;ll be acting as a close mentor throughout your time here, and you&#39;ll have real ownership of projects. We check in weekly as a team to review progress, tackle challenges, and share best practices. You&#39;ll also collaborate closely with the wider Marketing team and manage incoming projects through Wrike, our project management tool.&quot;&lt;/em&gt; — Gavin Jones, Brand Design Manager&lt;/div&gt;
